msgid "NW NW 1.7-2.7.95: NW Spielidee, Eingangsweg, Hausfront, Titelbild, Spielerauswahl, Intro"
msgstr "NW NW 1.7–2.7.95: NW Game concept, entrance path, front of the house, title screen, player selection, intro"

#. prog 1 @ 02b6 op print_sentence
#: script.p1.0x02b6
msgctxt "script.p1.0x02b6"
msgid "NW NW 8.7-9.7.95: NW \"Inzwischen\"-Bild, \"Stunden-Später\"-Bild, Küche, Garten, Flur, \"Kaboom\"-Bild"
msgstr "NW NW 8.7-9.7.95: NW \"In the meantime\" picture, \"Hours later\" picture, kitchen, garden, hallway, \"Kaboom\" picture"

#. prog 1 @ 0300 op print_sentence_plus
#: script.p1.0x0300
msgctxt "script.p1.0x0300"
msgid "NW NW 21.7-23.7.95: NW Kamera und diverse Fotos, Flur verbessert, Raum des Butlers, Fangroutine, Cheat-Ikone zum debuggen"
msgstr "NW NW 21.7–23.7.95: NW Camera and various photos, hallway improved, butler’s room, capture routine, cheat icon for debugging"

#. prog 1 @ 0352 op print_sentence
#: script.p1.0x0352
msgctxt "script.p1.0x0352"
msgid "29.7-30.7.95: NW Kamera-Cheat, Käfig und Auge im Raum des Butlers, Gang mit Kaktee und Lampen; Zerstörungssequenz"
msgstr "29.7–30.7.95: NW Camera cheat, cage and eye in the butler’s room, corridor with cactus and lamps; destruction sequence"

#. prog 1 @ 03a1 op print_sentence
#: script.p1.0x03a1
msgctxt "script.p1.0x03a1"
msgid "NW NW 5.8-6.8.95: NW Puzzleteile versteckt, Wasserglas eingeführt, Dialog mit Kaktus begonnen"
msgstr "NW NW 5.8–6.8.95: NW Puzzle pieces hidden, glass of water introduced, dialogue with the cactus started"

#. prog 1 @ 03e1 op print_sentence
#: script.p1.0x03e1
msgctxt "script.p1.0x03e1"
msgid "NW NW Dann eine große Pause. Ich hab' an meiner Bibliothek gearbeitet, versucht einige andere Sachen ins Rollen zu bringen."
msgstr "NW NW Then there was a long break. I worked on my library and tried to get a few other things moving."

#. prog 1 @ 0425 op print_sentence_plus
#: script.p1.0x0425
msgctxt "script.p1.0x0425"
msgid "NW NW 11.6-17.6.96: NW Diele eingebaut, Öl, Kalender, Toast und Diskette hinzugefügt, Kreditkarte und Show-Bild gemalt, Doom Sequenz und Tutorium geschrieben, Dachboden gemalt und eingebaut. Mond gemalt."
msgstr "NW NW 11.6–17.6.96: NW Entry hall implemented; oil, calendar, toast, and floppy disk added; credit card and show image painted; Doom sequence and tutorial written; attic painted and implemented. Moon painted."

#. prog 1 @ 04a9 op print_sentence
#: script.p1.0x04a9
msgctxt "script.p1.0x04a9"
msgid "18.6.96: NW Mansarde, Teleskop und Kinderzimmer gemalt und eingebaut. Mond und Maschine gemalt."
msgstr "18.6.96: NW Attic room, telescope, and children’s room painted and implemented. Moon and machine painted."

