msgstr "CLR The monitor has only one button, and it's broken."

#. prog 17 @ 0935 op add_say_window2
#: script.p17.0x0935
msgctxt "script.p17.0x0935"
msgid "CLR Nette Idee. NW Aber der Computer ist Idiotensicher und Wasserdicht."
msgstr "CLR Nice idea. NW But the computer is foolproof and watertight."

